<title>USA: TABLE-Fidelity National Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fidelity National Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30	     June 30</p>
<p>				1997	  1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenue		$178,458    $171,628  $331,650   $298,026</p>
<p>Earnings before</p>
<p>  income taxes	  15,075	11,757    20,197     20,057</p>
<p> Net earnings	    9,105	 6,946    12,127     12,091</p>
<p>Primary earnings</p>
<p>  per share		 0.63	  0.49	0.84	 0.85</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings</p>
<p>  per share		 0.52	  0.41	0.72	 0.74</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares outstanding:</p>
<p>  Primary		 14,504	14,219    14,499     14,178</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted	 19,104	18,663    19,073     18,535</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Fidelity National Financial Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
